# Fourth ASB screen (scripts/screen_hermes_asb.sh). Memory poisoning only works on
# task 0 (ASB's memory DBs) and rarely succeeds; prompt injection needs no memory DB.
# Part 1: the two attacker tools that work (CredentialVerificationTool memory naive,
# PublicationAccess memory combined_attack and OPI naive) on academic_search tasks 0-4,
# with observation and direct prompt injection.
